{"content_hash": "5ca84b00bfccfc65", "version_id": 963, "article_id": 97, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "OnePlus Ace 7 Pro adds cooling fans and a zoom camera to win gamers", "title_zh": "一加Ace 7 Pro来了：双风扇加潜望长焦，游戏党日常党都照顾到", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "mydrivers_ev", "source_url": "https://news.mydrivers.com/1/1165/1165652.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1567019001814-57350903e2af?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8YWNlJTIwcHJvfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQ2MjAwMTB8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Jason Abrams on Unsplash", "author": "Jason Abrams", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@jabrams5?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-green-golf-ball-sitting-on-top-of-a-green-field-EN3AVjMPZWA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(124, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(162, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "8fec7547c198"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-14", "word_count": 182, "reading_minutes": 0.9, "lead": "OnePlus has launched the Ace 7 Pro, a phone that keeps the gaming power of the standard Ace 7 but adds a better chip and a long-zoom camera. The company says it is the most complete phone in the Ace series so far.", "lead_zh": "一加推出了Ace 7 Pro，它保留了标准版Ace 7的游戏性能，同时升级了芯片，还加入了一颗长焦镜头。官方称这是Ace系列有史以来最全面的一代。", "preview": "The Ace 7 Pro uses a full version of the fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite chip, which is built on a 3nm process and can reach 4.6GHz. Alt", "preview_zh": "Ace 7 Pro搭载满血版第五代骁龙8至尊版芯片，采用3nm工艺，最高主频可达4.6GHz。虽然标准版Ace 7的芯片与之相近，但Pro版用的是完整旗舰规格，主动风扇也因此有了更大的发挥空间。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 945, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/97/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 70.075, "size_bytes": 421344, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 213, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@959f3ce/content/data/versions/963.json", "paragraphs": ["The Ace 7 Pro uses a full version of the fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite chip, which is built on a 3nm process and can reach 4.6GHz. Although the standard Ace 7 has a similar chip, the Pro model offers the complete flagship design, so the active cooling fans have more room to work.", "The biggest change is in photography. Besides the same 200-megapixel main camera, the Pro adds a 50-megapixel periscope lens with 3.5x zoom. This is the first time the Ace series has included such a lens, and it fixes a weak point that gamers used to accept.", "Our review unit comes in Midnight Black, with a matte glass-fibre back and a metal frame. The new Storm Island camera area hides the fan intake, and a small breathing light adds personality. The phone also keeps the 185Hz display, the 9000mAh battery and 100W fast charging.", "In testing, the battery lasted over 15 hours, and a full charge took only 49 minutes. The Ace 7 Pro clearly improves gaming performance, but it also handles everyday use much better than earlier Ace phones."], "paragraphs_zh": ["Ace 7 Pro搭载满血版第五代骁龙8至尊版芯片，采用3nm工艺，最高主频可达4.6GHz。虽然标准版Ace 7的芯片与之相近，但Pro版用的是完整旗舰规格，主动风扇也因此有了更大的发挥空间。", "最大的变化在影像。除了同样的2亿像素主摄，Pro版还加入了一颗5000万像素、3.5倍潜望长焦。这是Ace系列首次用上这类镜头，补上了游戏用户过去不得不接受的短板。", "我们拿到的评测机是极夜黑配色，磨砂玻纤背板配金属中框。全新的风暴岛镜头区把风扇进风口藏了进去，还有一颗小呼吸灯增添个性。手机也保留了185Hz屏幕、9000mAh电池和100W快充。", "实测中，电池续航超过15小时，充满电只需49分钟。Ace 7 Pro明显提升了游戏性能，但日常使用也比此前的Ace手机好得多。"], "body": "The Ace 7 Pro uses a full version of the fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite chip, which is built on a 3nm process and can reach 4.6GHz. Although the standard Ace 7 has a similar chip, the Pro model offers the complete flagship design, so the active cooling fans have more room to work.\n\nThe biggest change is in photography. Besides the same 200-megapixel main camera, the Pro adds a 50-megapixel periscope lens with 3.5x zoom. This is the first time the Ace series has included such a lens, and it fixes a weak point that gamers used to accept.\n\nOur review unit comes in Midnight Black, with a matte glass-fibre back and a metal frame. The new Storm Island camera area hides the fan intake, and a small breathing light adds personality. The phone also keeps the 185Hz display, the 9000mAh battery and 100W fast charging.\n\nIn testing, the battery lasted over 15 hours, and a full charge took only 49 minutes. The Ace 7 Pro clearly improves gaming performance, but it also handles everyday use much better than earlier Ace phones.", "body_zh": "Ace 7 Pro搭载满血版第五代骁龙8至尊版芯片，采用3nm工艺，最高主频可达4.6GHz。虽然标准版Ace 7的芯片与之相近，但Pro版用的是完整旗舰规格，主动风扇也因此有了更大的发挥空间。\n\n最大的变化在影像。除了同样的2亿像素主摄，Pro版还加入了一颗5000万像素、3.5倍潜望长焦。这是Ace系列首次用上这类镜头，补上了游戏用户过去不得不接受的短板。\n\n我们拿到的评测机是极夜黑配色，磨砂玻纤背板配金属中框。全新的风暴岛镜头区把风扇进风口藏了进去，还有一颗小呼吸灯增添个性。手机也保留了185Hz屏幕、9000mAh电池和100W快充。\n\n实测中，电池续航超过15小时，充满电只需49分钟。Ace 7 Pro明显提升了游戏性能，但日常使用也比此前的Ace手机好得多。", "text": "The Ace 7 Pro uses a full version of the fifth-generation Snapdragon 8 Elite chip, which is built on a 3nm process and can reach 4.6GHz. Although the standard Ace 7 has a similar chip, the Pro model offers the complete flagship design, so the active cooling fans have more room to work. The biggest change is in photography. Besides the same 200-megapixel main camera, the Pro adds a 50-megapixel periscope lens with 3.5x zoom. This is the first time the Ace series has included such a lens, and it fixes a weak point that gamers used to accept. Our review unit comes in Midnight Black, with a matte glass-fibre back and a metal frame. The new Storm Island camera area hides the fan intake, and a small breathing light adds personality. The phone also keeps the 185Hz display, the 9000mAh battery and 100W fast charging. In testing, the battery lasted over 15 hours, and a full charge took only 49 minutes. The Ace 7 Pro clearly improves gaming performance, but it also handles everyday use much better than earlier Ace phones.", "vocab": [{"word": "launch", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发布；推出", "note": "常用来说新产品上市", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "standard", "pos": "adj", "zh": "标准版的", "note": "与Pro版相对", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "process", "pos": "noun", "zh": "制程；工艺", "note": "指芯片制造工艺，如3nm", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "cooling", "pos": "noun", "zh": "散热；冷却", "note": "active cooling 指主动散热", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "periscope lens", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "潜望式长焦镜头", "note": "手机长焦常用说法", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "zoom", "pos": "noun", "zh": "变焦", "note": "3.5x zoom 即3.5倍变焦", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fix", "pos": "verb", "zh": "弥补；修复", "note": "fix a weak point 弥补短板", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "matte", "pos": "adj", "zh": "磨砂的", "note": "形容表面质感", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "last", "pos": "verb", "zh": "持续", "note": "指电池续航时间", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "everyday use", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "日常使用", "note": "与游戏场景相对", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-14T01:33:28.391504", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.375, "sm": 250, "em": 375, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Ace", "s": 0.375, "e": 0.6, "sm": 375, "em": 600, "cs": 4, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "7", "s": 0.6, "e": 0.925, "sm": 600, "em": 925, "cs": 8, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "Pro", "s": 0.925, "e": 1.25, "sm": 925, "em": 1249, "cs": 10, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "uses", "s": 1.25, "e": 1.55, "sm": 1250, "em": 1550, "cs": 14, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "a", "s": 1.55, "e": 1.675, "sm": 1550, "em": 1675, "cs": 19, "ce": 20, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "full", "s": 1.675, "e": 1.975, "sm": 1675, "em": 1975, "cs": 21, "ce": 25, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "version", "s": 1.975, "e": 2.312, "sm": 1975, "em": 2312, "cs": 26, "ce": 33, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "of", "s": 2.312, "e": 2.388, "sm": 2312, "em": 2387, "cs": 34, "ce": 36, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "the", "s": 2.388, "e"